#![allow(unused-uses)]

// todo
// - func[no-s]
//     in u->rs, if there's no func[no-s],
//         add "let s = self;"
//     in rs->u, if there's no "let s = self;" as the first item in method body,
//         add func[no-s]
//     else
//         delete the first item in u
//
// - open *.rs: read *.rs -> rust's ast -> write .*.u
// - write .*.u: u u-compile .*.u
//
// - in rust-to-u, when parsing macro_call!,
//      - try parsing it into Vec[Expr], if ok, then it's macro-call_() or [s]() or [b]()
//      - try parsing it into Vec[Stmt], if ok, then it's macro-call_{} or [s]{} or [p]{}
//      - otherwise, it's macro-call_[p]{} or macro-call_[s]{}
//
// - goto-definition jump to the correct position in u

